  "description": "PLCcom.Opc.Ua.Sdk is a commercial OPC UA SDK for .NET to build OPC UA clients and OPC UA servers in C# and VB.NET, both in a single assembly. Connect, browse, read, write and subscribe with a few lines of code; address nodes by NodeId or by readable browse path (e.g. Objects.Plant.Line1.Temperature). Supports Data Access, Alarms & Conditions, Historical Data and Historical Events, complex/structured data types, events, methods, Reverse Connect, opc.tcp and opc.https, certificate and user authentication, automatic connect and reconnect. OPC UA PubSub is available as add-on package PLCcom.Opc.Ua.PubSub. Runs on .NET Framework 4.7.2+, .NET Standard 2.1, .NET 8, .NET 9 and .NET 10. No runtime fees. Evaluation: without license data the SDK runs for 15 minutes with full functionality during a debug session; a free 14-day trial license is available. Workshop examples for client and server: https://github.com/Indi-An/PLCcom-OpcUaSdk-examples-dotnet",
  "iconFile": "PLCcom_mittel_quadratisch.png",
